      "message": "p2p: use different compact block nonces per network\n\nThis removes a very straightforward fingerprinting vector:\nAnyone could request the most recent tip as a compact block\nvia getdata(MSG_CMPCT_BLOCK) over a clearnet and a tor connection\nand then compare the nonces - if they match it's likely the same peer.",
